{"id":"torrey:death-of-the-wicked-the","source":"torrey","name":"Death Of The Wicked, The","slug":"death-of-the-wicked-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Is in their sins — Eze 3:19; Joh 8:21.","refs":[["Ezek",3,19,3,19],["John",8,21,8,21]]},{"text":"Is without hope — Pr 11:7.","refs":[["Prov",11,7,11,7]]},{"text":"Sometimes without fear — Jer 34:5; 2Ch 36:11-13.","refs":[["Jer",34,5,34,5],["2Chr",36,11,36,13]]},{"text":"Frequently sudden and unexpected — Job 21:13,23; 27:21; Pr 29:1.","refs":[["Job",21,13,21,13],["Job",21,23,21,23],["Job",27,21,27,21],["Prov",29,1,29,1]]},{"text":"Frequently marked by terror — Job 18:11-15; 27:19-21; Ps 73:19.","refs":[["Job",18,11,18,15],["Job",27,19,27,21],["Ps",73,19,73,19]]},{"text":"Punishment follows — Isa 14:9; Ac 1:25.","refs":[["Isa",14,9,14,9],["Acts",1,25,1,25]]},{"text":"The remembrance of them perishes in — Job 18:17; Ps 34:16; Pr 10:7.","refs":[["Job",18,17,18,17],["Ps",34,16,34,16],["Prov",10,7,10,7]]},{"text":"God has no pleasure in — Eze 18:23,32.","refs":[["Ezek",18,23,18,23],["Ezek",18,32,18,32]]},{"text":"Like the death of beasts — Ps 49:14.","refs":[["Ps",49,14,49,14]]},{"text":"Illustrated — Lu 12:20; 16:22,23.","refs":[["Luke",12,20,12,20],["Luke",16,22,16,22],["Luke",16,23,16,23]]},{"text":"Korah, &c. — Nu 16:32.","refs":[["Num",16,32,16,32]]},{"text":"Absalom. — 2Sa 18:9,10.","refs":[["2Sam",18,9,18,9],["2Sam",18,10,18,10]]},{"text":"Ahab. — 1Ki 22:34.","refs":[["1Kgs",22,34,22,34]]},{"text":"Jezebel. — 2Ki 9:33.","refs":[["2Kgs",9,33,9,33]]},{"text":"Athaliah. — 2Ch 23:15.","refs":[["2Chr",23,15,23,15]]},{"text":"Haman. — Es 7:10.","refs":[["Esth",7,10,7,10]]},{"text":"Belshazzar. — Da 5:30.","refs":[["Dan",5,30,5,30]]},{"text":"Judas. — Mt 27:5; Ac 1:18.","refs":[["Matt",27,5,27,5],["Acts",1,18,1,18]]},{"text":"Ananias, &c. — Ac 5:5,9,10.","refs":[["Acts",5,5,5,5],["Acts",5,9,5,9],["Acts",5,10,5,10]]},{"text":"Herod. — Ac 12:23.","refs":[["Acts",12,23,12,23]]}],"refCount":37}
